### API Gateway — porta unica de entrada.
### Todas as rotas dos servicos ficam acessiveis com um prefixo.

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Mapa de rotas
GET {{host}}/

### Catalogo (publico)
GET {{host}}/catalog/api/products?pageSize=5

### Cadastro
# @name cadastrar
POST {{host}}/identity/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruno Demo",
  "email": "gateway.demo@teste.com",
  "password": "senha-forte-123"
}

@accessToken = {{cadastrar.response.body.accessToken}}
@userId = {{cadastrar.response.body.userId}}

### Perfil pelo gateway
GET {{host}}/identity/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Carrinho pelo gateway
GET {{host}}/cart/api/carts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Pedidos pelo gateway
GET {{host}}/order/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Saude do proprio gateway
GET {{host}}/health/live
